{"t":"CVS","n":"CVS Health Corporation","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":79.65,"chg":-1.19,"chgPct":-0.01472,"prev":80.84,"dayH":80.37,"dayL":77.72,"w52H":110.68,"w52L":69.51,"vol":12236888,"avgVol":12690120,"mcap":101910118400,"pe":9.25,"fpe":9.15,"eps":8.61,"feps":8.7,"pb":1.27,"div":2.66,"divY":0.0334,"beta":0.58,"short":17875527,"shortPct":0.0141,"shortRatio":2.13,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Healthcare","sKo":"헬스케어","i":"Healthcare Plans","iKo":"의료 계획","city":"Woonsocket","emp":219000,"web":"https://www.cvshealth.com","sum":"CVS Health Corporation provides health solutions in the United States. The Health Care Benefits segment offers traditional, voluntary, and consumer-directed health insurance products and related services, including medical, pharmacy, dental, and behavioral health plans; medical management capabilities; Medicare Advantage and Medicare Supplement plans; prescription drug plans (PDPs); and Medicaid health care management services. It serves employer groups, individuals, college students, part-time and hourly workers, health plans, health care providers, governmental units, government-sponsored plans, labor groups, and expatriates. The Health Services segment offers pharmacy benefit management solutions, including plan design and administration, formulary management, retail pharmacy network ma","sumKo":"CVS Health Corporation은 미국에서 건강 솔루션을 제공합니다. 건강 관리 혜택 부문은 의료, 약국, 치과 및 행동 건강 계획을 포함하여 전통적이고 자발적이며 소비자 중심의 건강 보험 상품 및 관련 서비스를 제공합니다. 의료 관리 능력; Medicare Advantage 및 Medicare Supplement 플랜; 처방약 계획(PDP); Medicaid 의료 관리 서비스. 이 서비스는 고용주 그룹, 개인, 대학생, 시간제 근로자, 시간제 근로자, 건강 보험, 의료 서비스 제공자, 정부 단위, 정부 후원 보험, 노동 그룹 및 국외 거주자에게 서비스를 제공합니다. 건강 서비스 부문은 계획 설계 및 관리, 처방집 관리, 소매 약국 네트워크를 포함한 약국 혜택 관리 솔루션을 제공합니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":322467000000,"ni":4149000000},{"y":2023,"rev":357776000000,"ni":8344000000},{"y":2024,"rev":372809000000,"ni":4614000000},{"y":2025,"rev":402067000000,"ni":1768000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":10569300000